    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game you are waiting for 12 charming students of the Magic Academy. In an exciting puzzle game, you will have to find your way to the heart of each of them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405470/extras/dd8fc935c3982b198e129b70010f9f3c.poster.avif?t=1738214404\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405470/extras/dd8fc935c3982b198e129b70010f9f3c.webm?t=1738214404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405470/extras/dd8fc935c3982b198e129b70010f9f3c.mp4?t=1738214404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has more than 50 exciting levels, where you have to collect pictures with beautiful girls from pieces of paper. With each new level, you will discover more and more explicit images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405470/extras/1fa311533c7568b2a717591c3755195d.poster.avif?t=1738214404\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405470/extras/1fa311533c7568b2a717591c3755195d.webm?t=1738214404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405470/extras/1fa311533c7568b2a717591c3755195d.mp4?t=1738214404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find magicians for every taste!</p>",
